  <revision rev="2" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>b03f682ca911556fc351daaa9f7717ee</srcmd5>
    <version>2.4.1</version>
    <time>1795294037</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- update to 2.4.1:
  * Load symbols gated behing `__getattr__` during dynamic
    analysis (3faeeb1 by Timothée Mazzucotelli).
  * Stop checking attribute values (0670d03 by Timothée
    Mazzucotelli). Issue-506
  * Expose `reference_path` in addition to `canonical_path`
    (2f6b419 by Timothée Mazzucotelli). Issue-448
  * Preserve standalone named expression parentheses (dc6300d by
    Alperen). PR-488, Co-authored-by: Timothée Mazzucotelli
    &lt;dev@pawamoy.fr&gt;
  * Propagate `public` value to inherited members (aliases)
    (8b94205 by Timothée Mazzucotelli). Issue-495, PR-503, Co-
    authored-by: Sydney Duckworth
    &lt;sydduckworth@users.noreply.github.com&gt;
  * Prune function bodies from source before building AST
    (657ce96 by Timothée Mazzucotelli). PR-489
  * This requires the `griffe[faster]` extra. Griffe is fast by
    default so this performance improvement will only be
    noticeable in projects with *a lot of Python code*.</comment>
    <requestid>1399563</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
